WEBVTT

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.193
with no treatment.

00:04:30.217 --> 00:04:34.771
And by collecting more and more
data about metabolites

00:04:34.795 --> 00:04:38.339
and understanding
how changes in metabolites

00:04:38.363 --> 00:04:40.765
leads to developing diseases,

00:04:40.789 --> 00:04:44.278
our algorithms will get
smarter and smarter

00:04:44.302 --> 00:04:48.498
to discover the right therapeutics
for the right patients.

00:04:48.522 --> 00:04:52.292
And we will get closer to reach our vision

00:04:52.316 --> 00:04:56.179
of saving lives with every line of code.

00:04:56.203 --> 00:04:57.524
Thank you.

00:04:57.548 --> 00:05:01.375
(Applause)